          "text": "Yekoyakim ocamo ker ma mwaka me ditte pyeraryo wiye abic, ci obedo ka loc i Jerucalem pi mwaka apar wiye acel. Obedo ka tiyo gin ma nen marac i waŋ Rwot Lubaŋane, ",
