                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jedekia ocamo ker ma mwaka me ditte pyeraryo wiye acel, ci obedo ka loc i Jerucalem pi mwaka apar wiye acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obedo ka tiyo gin ma nen marac i waŋ Rwot Lubaŋane. En pe omwolle i nyim lanebi Jeremia, ma oloko kwede lok ma oa ki bot Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.17.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ejek 17.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jedekia bene ojemo i kom kabaka Nebukadnejar ma yam omiyo en ekwono kwon ki nyiŋ Lubaŋa; omiyo cwinye obedo nwaŋ ma pe mito lokke bot Rwot, Lubaŋa pa Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajwagi ma gin lutel kacel ki lwak mukene-gu ducu pe gugeno Rwot matwal, gubedo ka lubo gin me kwer pa rok mukene, omiyo gubalo kwede ot pa Rwot wo ko ma yam Rwot otyeko lonyo obedo leŋ i Jerucalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
