              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.44.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ic 44.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ciro kabaka me Percia owaco kuman ni, ‘Rwot, ma en Lubaŋa me polo, otyeko miyo ker ducu ma i wi lobo i ciŋa, dok ocika ni ager ot pire i Jerucalem, ma tye i Juda. Bot ŋat mo keken ma i kinwu ma i kom lwakke ducu awaco ni, Rwot Lubaŋane myero obed kwede. Wek en oa ociti.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.23"
            ]
